  "description": "Decision 535: runs of a ring. A double ring: the loop of ring-line.json moved to centre (5120, 4096), the inner track (edges 1-8, clockwise), and the same loop twice as large round it, the outer track (edges 9-16), never joined. Six stations A-F, each with a platform on the last 512 of inner edges 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7 and outer edges 9, 10, 11, 13, 14, 15, so the stops in order go clockwise: the inner way round is the inner track clockwise, the outer way the outer track anticlockwise. Runs (each leg five minutes, a minute at every stop between): D to A the inner way at 05:00, across the seam (D 05:00, E 05:05-05:06, F 05:11-05:12, A 05:17); a whole lap from A the inner way at 06:00 (back at A 06:35); a whole lap from A the outer way at 06:10 (back at A 06:45). Refused (invalidLineRuns): a lap without a way, a lap with six times for seven calls, a run from D the inner way to B with times for three legs; a ring with runs stays a ring. The headway is the inner way's two runs over 05:00 to 06:00, 70 minutes. Inner stands at D facing clockwise, Outer at A facing anticlockwise. Inner is sent five minutes before 05:00, keeps the run's times and does not turn round; at A at 05:17 it stands facing clockwise and takes the inner lap at 05:55 without turning; Outer takes the outer lap at 06:05 without turning. At 07:00 both stand at A. Final state: balance 3,000,000 - track 108,000 (36 lengths of 1024 at 3,000; the outer corners of 4,090 count 4) - six stations 900,000 - two trains 1,200,000 = 792,000; runDays [0, 0, 0]; Inner at A's inner berth (edge 1 forward, 1024), Outer at A's outer berth (edge 9 backward, 512).",
